[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3962.39, "timestamp": "01:06:02", "text": "えっと、アークの敵を3体破壊する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3964.87, "timestamp": "01:06:04", "text": "アーク合金を3つ確実に手に入れる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3966.71, "timestamp": "01:06:06", "text": "機械をいくつか倒して"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3967.56, "timestamp": "01:06:07", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You could have lived if you have someone to revive right UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/Mm5IY53bH7SEq7IP-MWAkAM"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3967.589, "timestamp": "01:06:07", "text": "アーク合金を手に入れろ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3969.67, "timestamp": "01:06:09", "text": "見なければならなかったとしても生き延びられただろう、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3981.91, "timestamp": "01:06:21", "text": "これは必要ないと思う。いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3985.349, "timestamp": "01:06:25", "text": "静かなレーダーは壊れたレーダーを意味するようなことはすべきではない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3989.829, "timestamp": "01:06:29", "text": "ああ、ハッチキー。ハッチキーは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3993.27, "timestamp": "01:06:33", "text": "レベル7でロック解除される。ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3995.75, "timestamp": "01:06:35", "text": "フィードを完了することで獲得できる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3998.069, "timestamp": "01:06:38", "text": "合金は強くて純粋だ。それは唯一の。略奪者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3999.51, "timestamp": "01:06:39", "text": "にとってガラクタなどというものはない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4002.47, "timestamp": "01:06:42", "text": "。ただ価値があるだけだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4006.39, "timestamp": "01:06:46", "text": "材料を集めることに関しては、リサイクルが肝心だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4008.309, "timestamp": "01:06:48", "text": "くそ、どんどん、どんどん、たくさんの"}]